{"4143570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Signal", "steam_appid": 4143570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of Black Signal — a covert unit operating in the shadows of modern warfare.<br><strong>War has changed. Instead of territory, nations fight for information. Your mission is simple: infiltrate secured</strong> locations, steal a computer, and get out before anyone notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a loud firefight — it’s tactical infiltration. Limited ammo, one robotic spider per mission, and no backup. Stay low, observe patrol routes, deploy your drone, breach camera systems, and disappear before alarms trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective:<br><strong>Get in. Secure the device. Get out.</strong><br>Clean, quiet, controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make mistakes and the mission collapses fast. You’re not here to destroy the world — you're here to steal its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD</strong> to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space</strong> to jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift</strong> to run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ctrl</strong> to crouch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to shoot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> to reload</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>V</strong> to deploy the spider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to detonate the spider — used to take down an enemy or affect certain objects in the area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C</strong> to access cameras near a cable box</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of Black Signal — a covert unit operating in the shadows of modern warfare.<br><strong>War has changed. Instead of territory, nations fight for information. Your mission is simple: infiltrate secured</strong> locations, steal a computer, and get out before anyone notices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a loud firefight — it’s tactical infiltration. Limited ammo, one robotic spider per mission, and no backup. Stay low, observe patrol routes, deploy your drone, breach camera systems, and disappear before alarms trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective:<br><strong>Get in. Secure the device. Get out.</strong><br>Clean, quiet, controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make mistakes and the mission collapses fast. You’re not here to destroy the world — you're here to steal its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD</strong> to move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space</strong> to jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift</strong> to run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ctrl</strong> to crouch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to shoot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R</strong> to reload</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>V</strong> to deploy the spider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Left click</strong> to detonate the spider — used to take down an enemy or affect certain objects in the area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C</strong> to access cameras near a cable box</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You are part of Black Signal. Infiltrate secured locations, steal a computer, and escape undetected. Use limited ammo, a single deployable spider, and stealth tactics to avoid patrols in tense, tactical missions.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143570/5ef75aec7cc06253da4e8cf10bfb596f613b5b46/header.jpg?t=1763726379", "capsule_image": "https://shared